      "summaries": {
        "en": "GTE-Multilingual-Base is a multilingual sentence embedding model that enables semantic similarity comparisons across 100+ languages, solving the challenge of cross-lingual information retrieval and content matching. It uses a shared transformer architecture with language-agnostic training to create comparable embeddings regardless of input language. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face's sentence-transformers library to build multilingual search systems, cluster documents across languages, or enhance cross-lingual recommendation engines with just a few lines of code.",
        "zh": "GTE-Multilingual-Base 是一个多语言句子嵌入模型，能够在100多种语言间进行语义相似度计算，解决了跨语言信息检索和内容匹配的难题。它采用共享的Transformer架构，通过语言无关的训练方法，使不同语言的文本生成可比较的向量表示。开发者可以通过Hugging Face的sentence-transformers库快速集成，用于构建多语言搜索引擎、跨语言文档聚类系统，或为推荐引擎添加多语言理解能力，只需几行代码即可实现跨语言语义匹配功能。",
        "es": "GTE-Multilingual-Base is a multilingual sentence embedding model that enables semantic similarity comparisons across 100+ languages, solving the challenge of cross-lingual information retrieval and content matching. It uses a shared transformer architecture with language-agnostic training to create comparable embeddings regardless of input language. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face's sentence-transformers library to build multilingual search systems, cluster documents across languages, or enhance cross-lingual recommendation engines with just a few lines of code.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "gte-multilingual-base stands out for sentence-transformers, safetensors, and new in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "GTE-Multilingual-Base is a multilingual sentence embedding model that enables semantic similarity comparisons across 100+ languages, solving the challenge of cross-lingual information retrieval and content matching. It uses a shared transformer architecture with language-agnostic training to create comparable embeddings regardless of input language. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face's sentence-transformers library to build multilingual search systems, cluster documents across languages, or enhance cross-lingual recommendation engines with just a few lines of code.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/Alibaba-NLP/gte-multilingual-base for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
